CNPG Extensions website
Copyright contributors to CNPG Extensions.

Website presentation follows the maintainer-approved CNPG Extensions prototype.
Extension documentation is imported at build time from cnpg-extensions and
cloudnative-pg/postgres-extensions-containers (Apache-2.0). Every page links to its
source revision. SBOMs and advisory reports are generated from published images;
third-party package license terms are preserved in those records.

Hextra by imfing and contributors is MIT-licensed; see themes/hextra/LICENSE.
Font licenses are retained under static/assets/fonts/.
Third-party project marks retain their original owners' rights; asset sources
are recorded in static/assets/extensions/sources.json. Marks identify featured
extensions, not endorsements. Jeremy Schneider's portrait is from https://ardentperf.com/about/
(https://ardentperf.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/image-11.png?w=200).
Biographical details were supplied by Jeremy Schneider.
